<?php
return ['name' => 'empowered_yi_wood_the_creator', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Empowered Yi Wood – The Creator', 'zh' => '身强乙木'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Empowered Yi Wood is like thriving vines and blooming flora – lively, resilient, and expressive in unique ways. When strong, its growth can be robust but also somewhat wild or chaotic if left unchecked. The true wisdom of Empowered Yi Wood lies not in spreading aimlessly, but in learning to channel softness and strength into targeted breakthroughs. By strategically leveraging others\' strengths and riding the right trends, this energy carves out an original path even in complex environments. In short, Empowered Yi Wood flourishes by blending gentle adaptability with decisive action, pioneering a creative route all Empowered Yi Wood\'s own.</p><p>Soft yet strong: Outwardly warm and approachable, yet inwardly tenacious and opinionated. You excel at using gentle methods to resolve conflict (\'softness overcoming hardness\').<br/>Logical and organized: You prefer to work methodically with clear goals. Your mind brings order to chaos and you plan your actions carefully.<br/>Highly adaptable: You can quickly find your footing in different environments, easily devising ways to cope with new situations.<br/>Stubborn streak: You like things on your own terms. In major decisions, beware of being too inflexible. If you learn to heed others\' advice, you\'ll often reap unexpected rewards.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Empowered Yi Wood benefits from Metal and Fire elements. Embracing Metal\'s clarity and Fire\'s inspiration smooths your energetic flow.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>You thrive by working steadily and diligently. Money accumulates gradually. Early in your career, focus on building a strong professional niche. By mid-career, you can integrate resources and see an explosion of wealth.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Watch your liver and gallbladder health. Get enough sleep and avoid heavy alcohol or greasy foods. Prevent joint and muscle strain by taking breaks. Monitor your thyroid and keep stress in check.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>When facing tough choices, you\'re prone to paralyzing indecision and internal conflict. To nourish your spirit, engage in slow-paced, calming hobbies. Try a tea ceremony, calligraphy, or similar meditative arts to soothe your nerves.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Recommended Industries: Education: Schools (especially early childhood or higher education), research institutes, online education. Culture & Media: Publishing, writing, library science, journalism. Consulting & Services: Counseling psychology, social work, non-profit organizations. Research & Tech: Fundamental scientific research, data management. Health & Wellness: Traditional medicine, nutrition, yoga instruction, wellness coaching. Design & Crafts: Fashion design, graphic design, floral design, handicrafts. Industries to Avoid: Judiciary & Military: Courtrooms, policing, military life. Heavy Machinery: Steel, heavy equipment manufacturing. High-Risk Finance: Investment banking, high-frequency trading. Construction & Civil Engineering: Rough construction sites, big engineering projects. Mining & Heavy Industry: Mining operations, large-scale logistics.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Wu Earth: A practical friend who helps you stay grounded in reality and avoid daydreams.</li><li>Geng Metal: A no-nonsense friend who cuts away your distractions and helps you focus on goals.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Geng Metal: An ideal partner who helps you make quick, firm decisions.</li><li>Bing Fire: A partner who energizes you and pushes you out of your comfort zone.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Katherine Johnson: The NASA mathematician who broke race and gender barriers, brilliant and meticulous with gentle determination</li><li>Oprah Winfrey: Media mogul and philanthropist known for empathy and empowering others</li><li>Beyoncé Knowles: Singer and philanthropist who channels deep emotion and creativity into her art and charity</li><li>Louis Pasteur: Father of microbiology, inventor of pasteurization and vaccines, who changed the world through patient research</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Lei Jun: Founder of Xiaomi Technology, who built success with a calm, persistent approach</li><li>Liu Qiangdong (Richard Liu): Founder of JD.com, quietly strategic in revolutionizing e-commerce</li><li>Deng Jiaxian: Physicist and key figure in China\'s atomic bomb project, who worked humbly behind the scenes</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_dailytips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Avoid wearing denim too often (softer fabrics align better with your gentle energy)</li><li>When taking public transport, try to sit by the window to recharge with passing scenery</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>White (Metal): Symbolizes clarity and purity, helping you rein in scattered energy.</li><li>Red & Pink (Fire): Red brings passion and drive, while pink offers gentle social warmth.</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>West (Metal): Facing west helps you consolidate energy and strengthen decision-making.</li><li>South (Fire): When you need to pick up pace, face south to speed up and act with urgency.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>乙木如花草藤蔓，灵动柔韧，擅长以独特的方式表达生命力。身强则木性刚韧，容易呈现无序的野蛮生长。真正的智慧，不在于盲目蔓延，而在于学会将柔中带刚的特质转化为精准的突破之力。</p><p>柔中带刚：外表柔和亲切，内心坚韧有主见，善于以柔克刚来化解矛盾。<br/>逻辑性强：做事有条不紊，行动目标明确。<br/>适应能力强：能在不同环境中快速找到应对方式。<br/>性格固执：在重大决策中避免过于固执，若能倾听他人意见，往往能带来意想不到的收获。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身强乙木，喜用神为金、火。懂得借力，就能让自身的能量更顺畅，优势发挥得更稳定。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>适合脚踏实地做事，钱是慢慢攒起来的。年轻时需积累专业壁垒，中年后可通过资源整合迎来财富爆发。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>注意肝胆健康，少熬夜，避免油腻和酒精；预防筋骨劳损，久坐久站适当休息；关注甲状腺情况，保持情绪稳定，避免过度疲劳。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>很容易因目标受阻产生焦躁情绪，可通过登山、搏击等动态活动释放压力。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：金融业：银行业、证券业、精算师、会计。医疗业：外科医生、牙医、针灸师。美容业：美容师、化妆师。精密技术与IT业：程序员（特别是前端、UI）、精密仪器、钟表制造。文化艺术与传媒业：作家、画家、设计师、摄影师、广告策划、媒体编辑。教育培训与咨询业：教师、培训师、演讲家、心理咨询师。娱乐演艺业：演员、主持人、模特、舞蹈家。餐饮：花艺、茶艺、咖啡师、厨师。房地产与建筑业：房地产经纪、室内设计、景观设计。零售与贸易业：服装店、精品店、礼品店、贸易公司。人力资源与行政管理：HR、行政、秘书。慎重行业：渔业、水产养殖业。航运、船务。林业、造纸业。纺织业。种植业。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>戊土：戊土可以帮你聚焦现实，脱离空想。</li><li>庚金：庚金可以帮助你斩断无谓牵绊、聚焦目标。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>庚金：庚金可以帮助你快速做出决策。</li><li>丙火：丙火可以激发你的活力，让你突破舒适圈获得成长。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Malala Yousafzai：最年轻的诺贝尔和平奖得主，争取女性教育权并且资助全球女童教育</li><li>Brad Pitt：好莱坞巨星</li><li>Satya Nadella：微软CEO</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>林丹：羽毛球双圈全满贯</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_dailytips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>吃辛辣食物</li><li>去健身房举铁可以释放消极情绪</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>白色（金）：白色象征清晰与纯粹，能帮助乙木收敛过于扩散的能量，增强判断力和效率。</li><li>红色 / 粉色（火）：红色代表热情与动力，粉色则带来柔和的人际能量。二者结合，不仅能提升行动力，还能增强社交魅力。</li></ul>'], 'lucksuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>西方（金）：面向西方，能帮助甲木凝聚能量，增强决策力，不再犹豫摇摆。</li><li>南方（火）：在需要加快节奏、提升执行力的时候，可以多朝南方，或在南方布置一些喜欢的物件。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
